            "review_title": "Review at HCM Domestic Airport Resto",
            "review_text": "Alessi831\n28 contributions\n0\nWorst immigration experience in memory. Lies, aggression, ineptitude, unprofessionalism, and (likely) corruption.\nApr 2023 • Solo\nI’m in airports several times a week (making that over 100 in a year), and this is the worst in memory. The facilities are fine, and some employees are very nice, but the uniformed employees go out of their way to lie to and harass passengers. The level of petty bullying, poor guidance, and outright rude treatment made me question why anyone visits this place. I’ve been here many times, and while I’m sure the Vietnamese people are still just as nice, the officials are outright aggressive and rude. It seems contrary to a country that wants tourists to visit. If I could give this airport negative stars I would.\nRead more\nWritten April 10, 2023",
