            "review_text": "David\nThailand137 contributions\n0\nbe prepared for stupidity\nApr 2017 • Couples\nHotel was 6k away, the roads surprisingly clear, great taxi driver arrived at Ho Chi Min terminal 1 domestic airport within 25mins at 1pm, we were intentionally early going to try to hop on a earlier flight than booked. Our 5pm flight was the earlier flight as it turns out 😲🤣🤔🤔🙀. Two and a half hours to check in, we did do on line but apparently still need the boarding pass, digital age not reached here yet. The Q's were huge, but worse than that were all the Koreans and Japanese who turned up thinking its a domestic flight can get through quick. They did at the expense of everyone else waiting jn line, really annoying lack of control. \nYet another reason why HCM is off the return visit list.\nRead more\nWritten April 15, 2017",
