            "review_text": "Simon D\nSawtell, Australia465 contributions\n0\nEasy airport for English speakers\nJul 2016 • Family\nWe did a Jetstar Pacific flight to Da Nang. \n\nAllow 2 hrs before flight if leaving from center of town. It is about 40min from city center and bookin says it closes 40min before flight. \n\nSigns in English, Jetstar no worries. Security as normal. Once through security, happy rooms and a small food area, much cheaper then Aus, noodles etc for 3-4$.\n\nAfter seeing the sinks in the happy room filled with king prawns and the other with octopus, Blocks of ice in urinals... A bit different! but everything cleaner then Sydney airport. Easy to navigate\nRead more\nWritten July 7, 2016",
