            "review_text": "Alex\nPerth, Australia49 contributions\n0\nTo pass the time\nJan 2013 • Couples\nIf your looking for a way to pass the time then this is the place. It has free WiFi, lots of choice and the food is ok.\n\nMy wife and I had to kill several hours so we had lunch here. I had the green Cray chicken and she had the chicken noodle soup the food was nice, nothing spectacular and it arrived very quickly. There is lots of variety on the menu and the place is very clean. The food is a bit over priced but it is at an airport and there is nothing else worth while for some time.\n\nThe down sides are the toilets are horrible, the WiFi didn't work for me and the service after receiving the meal was pretty bad. After finishing our meal it took at least 30minutes to for staff to clear our table and I had for the bill several times.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 19, 2013",
            "rating": 5.0,
