            "review_text": "BigOilAdelaide\nAdelaide64 contributions\n0\nA pleasant surprise\nNov 2012 • Couples\nLocated downstairs at the domestic terminal Sky is offering real food and drink as opposed to the usual airport standard fare. Mr Big Oil had a feed of beef noodle pho and spring rolls. The spring rolls rated as the best eaten so far in Vietnam and the pho was authentic and fresh. Spotless clean and cool premises with free wifi, much nicer way to kill an hour then upstairs. Was reasonably pricey but what airport food isn't? An all round good experience. Good day to you skynet restaurant!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 9, 2012",
